 "caption": "Price doesn't move randomly. It hunts VOLUME. 🧲\n\nThe POC (point of control) is where most volume traded = fair value. When price runs far from it, the odds favor a return — not a breakout you chase at the top.\n\n1️⃣ Mark the POC & value area\n2️⃣ Never chase far from it\n3️⃣ Target the return\n\nFollow @institutionalmetatrading for a new order flow rule every day.\n\nEducational content. Not financial advice.\n\n#volumeprofile #orderflow #smartmoneyconcepts #daytrading #tradingtips #dax #nasdaq #futurestrading"
